{"schema":1,"id":"deeper-focus","title":"Deeper Focus","composer":"Claude","concept":"further down, where the work does itself.","about":["Deeper Focus is the same room as Focus, later at night: the floor drops a fifth to D, the clock slows to sixty, and in place of the kalimba a bass rocks between root and fifth like a tide against a hull. Harmony circulates in threes \u2014 Dm, F, C \u2014 never arriving, never needing to.","Five layers loop on cycles of 16, 12, 14, 10 and 8 bars, pairwise non-multiple, so their alignment never repeats inside a working session. The conductor is quieter here too: it drifts levels and rests voices, and the room mostly just breathes."],"accent":"#6d94ad","key":"D dorian","bpm":60,"layers":[{"id":"bed","name":"bed","role":"bed","always":true,"gain":0.8,"gainRange":[0.68,0.9],"minOn":60,"minOff":0,"variants":[{"file":"audio/bed-a.m4a","loopSeconds":64.0,"notes":[[0.0,64.0,38,50],[0.0,64.0,45,42],[0.0,36.0,50,52],[0.0,36.0,57,56],[8.0,20.0,62,34],[28.0,44.0,38,60],[28.0,44.0,45,56]],"tailSeconds":14.462}]},{"id":"pad-low","name":"harmony","role":"pad","gain":0.6,"gainRange":[0.42,0.72],"minOn":45,"minOff":20,"variants":[{"file":"audio/pad-low-a.m4a","loopSeconds":48.0,"notes":[[0.0,18.0,52,58],[0.0,18.0,53,58],[0.0,18.0,57,58],[0.0,18.0,60,58],[0.0,18.0,62,58],[16.0,18.0,52,58],[16.0,18.0,53,58],[16.0,18.0,57,58],[16.0,18.0,60,58],[32.0,22.0,52,58],[32.0,22.0,55,58],[32.0,22.0,57,58],[32.0,22.0,60,58]],"tailSeconds":12.466},{"file":"audio/pad-low-b.m4a","loopSeconds":48.0,"notes":[[0.0,16.0,53,55],[0.0,16.0,57,55],[0.0,16.0,60,55],[0.0,16.0,62,55],[14.0,18.0,55,55],[14.0,18.0,57,55],[14.0,18.0,59,55],[14.0,18.0,62,55],[30.0,24.0,55,55],[30.0,24.0,57,55],[30.0,24.0,60,55],[30.0,24.0,64,55]],"tailSeconds":12.478}]},{"id":"haze","name":"haze","role":"pad","gain":0.42,"gainRange":[0.28,0.55],"minOn":40,"minOff":30,"variants":[{"file":"audio/haze-a.m4a","loopSeconds":56.0,"notes":[[4.0,12.0,74,54],[4.0,12.0,81,54],[22.0,12.0,76,51],[22.0,12.